</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>White</surname><given-names>TW</given-names></name><name><surname>Paul</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Connections with connexins: the molecular basis of direct intercellular signaling</article-title><source>Eur J Biochem</source><year>1996</year><volume>238</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>27</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8665925</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chandross</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kessler</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Cohen</surname><given-names>RI</given-names></name><name><surname>Simburger</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Spray</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Bieri</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Dermietzel</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Altered connexin expression after peripheral nerve injury</article-title><source>Mol Cell Neurosci</source><year>1996a</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>501</fpage><lpage>518</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8875432</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chandross</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Spray</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Cohen</surname><given-names>RI</given-names></name><name><surname>Kumar</surname><given-names>NM</given-names></name><name><surname>Kremer</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Dermietzel</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kessler</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>TNF&#x003b1; inhibits Schwann cell proliferation, connexin46 expression, and gap junctional communication</article-t